OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 87, dies after being hit by  
OL,4,Acar                                    
OL,6,FAn 87-year-old man has died after being
OL,7,Fstruck by a car in Larbert.            
OL,9,FEmergency crews responded after the man
OL,10,Fwas hit by a black Mazda 6 on the A88  
OL,11,FBellsdyke Road, near the junction with 
OL,12,FMcCartney Road, at about 17:30 on      
OL,13,FFriday.                                
OL,15,FHe was pronounced dead at the scene a  
OL,16,Fshort time later. Police Scotland said 
OL,17,Fhis family had been made aware.        
OL,19,FThe road was closed for about six hours
OL,20,Fto allow an initial investigation to   
OL,21,Ftake place.                            
